      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is good feedback. We have no present method by which we notify users about their own avatar state (other than the Avatar Stats menu).\n\nThat being said, if your DB/DBC count in the Avatar Stats is Red or Dark Red (Poor or Very Poor), then your DB will be disabled by default.\n\nImplementing a \"DB disabled\" icon for other users on nameplates could be something we do in a future iteration.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
