      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I was thinking of putting a small icon or bit of text in the avatar stats menu. Putting it on the nameplate sounds good too, but the nameplates are already quite saturated as they are.\n\nPutting it in the avatar stats menu would also allow users to see that their *own* dynamic bones are disabled, because you can view your own stats.",
      "viewerReactions": null
