  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-23T16:54:09.141Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to see a small icon or message added to the \"Avatar Stats\" menu, indicating that the currently selected avatar is over the user's chosen dynamic bone limit.\n\nThis will give newer users a better understanding of why their avatar's physics may not be working ingame, as well as hint to the fact that the dynamic bone limit exists.",
